  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.Compression.IncludeHiddenAndSystemDescription" xml:space="preserve">具有 Hidden 或 System 屬性的項目也會加入壓縮檔。</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.ExcludedPatterns.Header" xml:space="preserve">壓縮排除清單</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.ExcludedPatterns.Description" xml:space="preserve">此清單中的樣式會在壓縮時略過。支援 .gitignore 相容語法（例如 *.log、node_modules/、!keep.txt）。</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.ExcludedPatterns.Placeholder" xml:space="preserve">例如 *.log 或 node_modules/</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.ExcludedPatterns.Add" xml:space="preserve">新增</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.ExcludedPatterns.Remove" xml:space="preserve">移除</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.ExcludedPatterns.Reset" xml:space="preserve">還原預設值</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.ExcludedPatterns.OpenFile" xml:space="preserve">開啟排除檔案</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.ExcludedPatterns.OpenFile.Tip" xml:space="preserve">在預設文字編輯器中開啟 .lhaignore</x:String>
  <x:String x:Key="Text.Settings.ExcludedPatterns.RespectGitignore" xml:space="preserve">同時使用來源中的 .gitignore</x:String>
